43:["$","div","7",{"className":"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border/50 bg-card","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-lg mb-3","children":"How do I know which path is right for me?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Consider: Do you feel more drawn to meditative silence, asceticism, and dissolution of the ego (Shaiva tendency)? Or do you feel drawn to loving relationship with a personal God, devotional singing, and service (Vaishnava tendency)? The Faith Finder can help you explore this."}]]}]
