":"twitter:title","content":"Shaivism vs Vaishnavism: The Two Great Paths of Hindu Devotion"}],["$","meta","20",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Shaivism (the path of Shiva) and Vaishnavism (the path of Vishnu) are the two largest devotional traditions in Sanatan Dharma. A complete guide to their philosophies, practices, and differences."}]]
